{
  "manifest_version": "1",
  "description": "Reproducible CCEL source for Jamieson, Fausset & Brown's \"Commentary Critical and Explanatory on the Whole Bible\" (1871, public domain). Unlike Calvin's per-volume CCEL files, JFB is published by CCEL as a single ThML/XML file covering the entire Bible (div1 'x' = Old Testament, div1 'xi' = New Testament, div2 = one Bible book each, div3 = chapter/introduction). No raw XML is committed to git (data/raw/ is gitignored); fetch with scripts/build_commentary_database.py --jfb-fetch, which downloads the url and verifies raw_sha256 before use. Each entry in 'books' below names one div2 (one canonical Bible book) within that single file; contributor_raw_name is the literal 'Commentary by ...' attribution text CCEL prints at the start of that book's own commentary (JFB divided authorship of the whole Bible by book: Jamieson wrote Genesis-Esther, Fausset wrote Job-Malachi plus most epistles and Revelation, Brown wrote the Gospels/Acts/Romans - this is stated in the source text itself for every one of the 66 books, not inferred).",
  "source": {
